        expected.add(new JobAd(4L,"Software Developer – Heidelberg – Logistics – Java, Microservices, Spring Boot, Azure, IoT - €80,000", "Software Developer – Heidelberg – Logistics – Java, Microservices, Spring Boot, Azure, IoT - €80,000Our client are pioneers in the field of software-based infrastructure and vehicle diagnostics, specializing in the early detection of disruptions in railway systems. They operate the world’s largest IoT platform for switch logistics.This company combines the flexibility of a dynamic, agile technology start-up with the opportunities and development possibilities offered by a large corporation.Your Responsibilities:You will develop IoT applications based on Java.You will work in an interdisciplinary, agile team alongside UX designers and backend developers on innovative railway digitalization projects.You will design new requirements and propose possible solutions, discussing them within the team.Your Profile:You have several years of professional experience using Java.Software development is a craft for you, and you use up-to-date tools to program efficiently and test your code.You enjoy technical challenges and continuous improvement.You have some experience in agile software development using Scrum, including tools like Jira and Confluence.Keywords: Java, Spring Boot, Microservices, Azure, cloud, Kubernetes, software, development, Agile, Scrum, IoTThe company have 2 positions available and limited interview slots so apply now to avoid missing out!", "Findr", "https://de.linkedin.com/jobs/view/software-developer-%E2%80%93-heidelberg-%E2%80%93-logistics-%E2%80%93-java-microservices-spring-boot-azure-iot-%E2%82%AC80-000-at-findr-4034753343?trk=public_jobs_topcard-title", "Heidelberg, Baden-Württemberg, Germany"));
        expected.add(new JobAd(8L,"Backend Java Developer", "Job Title:Backend Java DeveloperLocation: Berlin, NONEEmployment Type:PermanentOur Client:We are currently searching for a dedicated expert to join our clients team as a Java Backend Developer.Responsibilities:Development of internal and external APIs based on Java or Kotlin.Automation of processes with Spring Boot.Ensuring code quality through testing, logging, and comprehensive documentation.Conceptualizing and developing complex applications.Designing solution strategies and creating services with Docker in an agile environment.Handling CI and CD processes facilitated through GitLab.Your Profile:Education: Successful completion of studies or an equivalent qualification.Technical Skills: Fluent in Java, with a focus on writing clean code. Several years of experience in development with Java frameworks such as Spring Boot. Proficient with Git and development tools.Characteristics: Enjoyment of independent work, teamwork, and dedication. Familiarity with unit tests and code reviews.Halian Group:With over two decades of experience, we understand that innovation is crucial for delivering agile, practical solutions that transform businesses and careers.Our tech-talent and intelligent services enable you to unlock tomorrow's potential. Explore the remarkable possibilities that arise when the right people and technologies come together.Backend Java Developer in Berlin, NONE", "Halian", "https://de.linkedin.com/jobs/view/backend-java-developer-at-halian-4019613685?trk=public_jobs_topcard-title", "Berlin, Berlin, Germany"));
